    "detailed_description": "Gun on the Chickahominy (GotC) is a casual pixel target game set during the American War Between the States. Players take command of a small cannon crew situated on the banks of the Chickahominy River and attempt to stem the Federal invasion of Virginia. The game offers colorful retro graphics,  casual yet compelling gameplay, and reimagined period music.<br><br>You alone can protect the capital against the Federals as they attempt to cross the Chickahominy River!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/0a796b4b5e180d6b7d2c8a26114c93c0.poster.avif?t=1621621510\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/0a796b4b5e180d6b7d2c8a26114c93c0.webm?t=1621621510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">6 Levels Of Cannon-blasting Fun!</h2>Navigate the world map to enter new levels!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/f1ccc3776900a5bba360c00fed8c779d.poster.avif?t=1621621510\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/f1ccc3776900a5bba360c00fed8c779d.gif?t=1621621510\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">7 Unique Enemy Types!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/7c7ebca302ae419110fb8d5a9b9a2629.poster.avif?t=1621621510\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607780/extras/7c7ebca302ae419110fb8d5a9b9a2629.webm?t=1621621510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 clas